_HALF_EVEN, 2.675 \u2192 2.68 because 7 is odd, rounds to even 8. Actually 2.675 \u2192 2.68. Yes.)\n- 2.665 \u2192 2.66 (ROUND_HALF_EVEN: 2.665 \u2192 2.66 because 6 is even, stays even. Yes.)\n\nSo the fix is to change ROUND_HALF_UP to ROUND_HALF_EVEN.\n\nLet me create a branch and commit the fix.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13c3d4b827490af31728f", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"fix-bankers-rounding\"}", "name": "create_branch"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13c3d52477752a191f5f5", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"fix-bankers-rounding\",\"message\":\"Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/money.py\",\"content\":\"from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\\n\\n\\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\\\"0.01\\\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\\n\"}]}", "name": "commit_changes"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13c3d55227d738cf71442", "function": {"arguments": "{\"ref\":\"fix-bankers-rounding\"}", "name": "trigger_ci"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13c3d58cc71718d37e39f", "function": {"arguments": "{\"run_id\":\"ci-0001\"}", "name": "wait_for_ci"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "CI passed.